This package implements the platform interface of the FlutterFire
firebase_auth plugin (firebase_auth_platform_interface, Copyright 2020 the
Chromium project authors, BSD 3-Clause license) and the platform interface of
firebase_core (firebase_core_platform_interface, BSD 3-Clause license). It
depends on those packages; it does not copy their code. The work is done by
firebase_auth_providers_dart, an unofficial pure-Dart client of the Firebase
Auth REST API.

